.env
logs*/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.png
.DS_Store

# Trajectory .eval files stay out of git (team decision, 2026-10-30). One N=500
# dataset run is ~162MB and the full local set is ~2.3GB; git-lfs is not set up
# and GitHub rejects files over 100MB. Trajectories are reproducible from
# src/record.py, and results/ already carries the per-sample scores derived from
# them, so nothing analysable is lost by keeping them local.
#
# Only the .eval binaries are ignored, so READMEs and any small metadata next to
# them can still be committed.
#
# NOTE: trajectories/model-sonnet55-n100/ predates this rule and is still
# tracked (3 files, 16MB). Ignoring a path does not untrack what is already in,
# so those stay until someone decides to remove them.
trajectories/**/*.eval

# Experiment records ARE version-controlled: derived figures and tidy data
# are small, and the report is the deliverable. Raw .eval logs stay out.
!experiments/**/*.png
experiments/**/*.eval
